yle=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0;\"><strong>phone:</strong> 087 702 5904</p>\n                <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0;\"><strong>mobile:</strong></p>\n                <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0;\"><strong>fax:</strong> 086 565 4597</p>\n                <p style=\"margin: 0 0 0 0;\"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:unityeb@futurasa.co.za\" style=\"color: #2e7d32;\">unityeb@futurasa.co.za</a></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n    \n    <p style=\"margin: 15px 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold; color: #000000;\">\n        Futura SA is a Level 1 B-BBEE contributor, committed to transformation and inclusive growth.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #666; line-height: 1.4;\">\n        <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> Futura SA Administrators (Pty) Ltd is an authorized Financial Services Provider licensed by the Financial Sector Conduct Authority in terms of the FAIS Act. License Number 18287 and a licensed Section 13B Administrator number 24/760. This transmission is confidential and intended solely for the person or organization to whom it is addressed. If you have received this transmission in error, please notify us immediately by e-mail at <a href=\"mailto:info@futurasa.co.za\" style=\"color: #666;\">info@futurasa.co.za</a>.\n    </p>\n</div>'),(143,264,1,'RE_DELEGATED','Task moved from Unassigned to omega','N/A','2026-08-03 17:48:38.897662',NULL);
