soNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">The client asked on 4 June, what is outstanding, so I want to make sure, as your email below is dated 15 April</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\">Thank you.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Kind Regards,</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:black\"><img width=\"908\" height=\"188\" id=\"Picture_x0020_1394905041\" src=\"cid:image001.png@01DD15D8.AFA4DF40\" style=\"width:9.4583in; height:1.9583in\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt; font-family:Montserrat; color:black\">Please consider the environment before printing;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt; font-family:Montserrat; color:black\">In line with the Protection of Personal Information Act, 04 of 2013 (“POPIA”) and other relevant legislation, we have a legal duty to protect the information we process. The contents of this e-mail and any files or attachments transmitted with it are confidential, may be legally privileged and may not be disclosed, copied, or used by anyone other than the addressee, nor may it be used or copied or distributed without the consent of the sender. If you are not the intended recipient, please tell us by reply and delete all copies on your system. While we have taken reasonable steps to secure information and to implement precautions against cyber threats, Knights Insurance Brokers will not be liable for any damages or loss resulting from malicious software coding, viruses, hacking, disruption, or data corruption that may arise from this email. To protect information and ensure security, we reserve the right to monitor, intercept, access, and block e-mails addressed to anyone within Knights Insurance Brokers</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><div><div style=\"border:none; border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Merril Fennessy &lt;merril@futurasa.co.za&gt; <br><b>Sent:</b> Friday, 17 July 2026 10:37<br><b>To:</b> Angelo George &lt;angelo@knightsinsurance.co.za&gt;; Peter Maphutha &lt;peter@knightsinsurance.co.za&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Unity EB &lt;unityeb@futurasa.co.za&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> RE: FAR0217 RO Swika Foods t/a Wimpy Highveld Witbank Response from Team Recon</span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Morning</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">I have checked follow ups to the Email from the Recon Team below, to date no responses on Recon Team queries.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">The queries relate to exits, and member to reconcile the actual data.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;Unity EB<br><b>Sent:</b>&nbsp;Wednesday, April 15, 2026 3:58 PM<br><b>To:</b>&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:info@roswika.co.za\" title=\"mailto:info@roswika.co.za\">info@roswika.co.za</a><br><b>Cc:</b>&nbsp;Gail Le Roux &lt;<a href=\"mailto:gail@futurasa.co.za\" title=\"mailto:gail@futurasa.co.za\">gail@futurasa.co.za</a>&gt;; Unity &lt;<a href=\"mailto:unity@futurasa.co.za\" title=\"mailto:unity@futurasa.co.za\">unity@futurasa.co.za</a>&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b>&nbsp;URGENT&nbsp;FAR0217&nbsp;RO Swika Foods t/a Wimpy Highveld Witbank</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Dear Maud Goxo</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">We have been advised that you are the contact person for this store.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Kindly note that we need to do updates from January 2021 and have been advised by our Client Relationship Manager Gail, <span style=\"background:yellow\">that staff did not work for January 2021 to April 2021</span>, and that all members are aware that no deductions were made from their salaries for this period.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">We will need to <span style=\"background:yellow\">charge for costs to administer the fund for these 4 months</span>, and Gail has confirmed that we will not require signed break in service forms nor proof of member communication.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">To start with updates from <span style=\"background:yellow\">January 2021, we need to know who left your service from 1/1/2021 to 1/5/2021</span>, as the <span style=\"background:yellow\">schedules received May 2021 has 11 members less than the last schedule submitted (March 2020) which has 28 members</span>.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Kindly have a look at the list of <span style=\"background:yellow\">28 members in 2020, and the list at May 2021 of 17</span> and <span style=\"background:yellow\">advise dates of leaving service, date of last contribution and the reason, resigned, dismissed etc. for the 11 missing members so that we can remove them at the correct dates and send claim forms to you for them.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">We await your urgent response.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Many Thanks</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"