3C1;\r\n	text-decoration:underline}\r\np.MsoListParagraph, li.MsoListParagraph, div.MsoListParagraph\r\n	{margin-top:0cm;\r\n	margin-right:0cm;\r\n	margin-bottom:0cm;\r\n	margin-left:36.0pt;\r\n	font-size:12.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif}\r\nspan.EmailStyle20\r\n	{font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif;\r\n	color:windowtext}\r\n.MsoChpDefault\r\n	{font-size:10.0pt}\r\n@page WordSection1\r\n	{margin:72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt}\r\ndiv.WordSection1\r\n	{}\r\nol\r\n	{margin-bottom:0cm}\r\nul\r\n	{margin-bottom:0cm}\r\n-->\r\n</style></head><body lang=\"EN-ZA\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Dear Mymoena,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Kindly find the attached schedule and POP for May 2026. Our business has hit a snag currently and we are on our way to recovery.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">The ID Number for Rabukosi has been corrected in the attached schedule.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Mr Thulani Vincent Masemola was dismissed effective the 11<sup>th</sup> March 2026. His last contribution to the Fund was 28<sup>th</sup> February 2026.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Please advise on the credits for March and April which we paid.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Kind Regards</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Vongani Mashaba</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Famous Brands Multi Franchisee (Debonairs, Steers &amp; Wimpy)</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Mobile: +27(0)83 469 5112</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">E-Mail: <a href=\"mailto:Vongani.mashaba@icloud.com\"><span style=\"color:#0563C1\">Vongani.mashaba@icloud.com</span></a></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"left\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"8\" height=\"95\"></td></tr><tr><td></td><td><img width=\"288\" height=\"92\" src=\"cid:image004.png@01DD1603.CBF8DC20\" style=\"width:3.0in; height:.9583in\"></td></tr></tbody></table></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><br clear=\"ALL\" style=\"\"><div><div style=\"border:none; border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> Unity EB &lt;unityeb@futurasa.co.za&gt; <br><b>Sent:</b> 17 July 2026 14:21<br><b>To:</b>