text;\r\n	font-weight:normal;\r\n	font-style:normal}\r\nspan.EmailStyle22\r\n	{font-family:\"Century Gothic\",sans-serif;\r\n	color:windowtext}\r\n.MsoChpDefault\r\n	{font-size:10.0pt}\r\n@page WordSection1\r\n	{margin:72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt}\r\ndiv.WordSection1\r\n	{}\r\n-->\r\n</style></head><body lang=\"EN-ZA\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Morning</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">I have checked follow ups to the Email from the Recon Team below, to date no responses on Recon Team queries.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">The queries relate to exits, and member to reconcile the actual data.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;Unity EB<br><b>Sent:</b>&nbsp;Wednesday, April 15, 2026 3:58 PM<br><b>To:</b>&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:info@roswika.co.za\" title=\"mailto:info@roswika.co.za\">info@roswika.co.za</a><br><b>Cc:</b>&nbsp;Gail Le Roux &lt;<a href=\"mailto:gail@futurasa.co.za\" title=\"mailto:gail@futurasa.co.za\">gail@futurasa.co.za</a>&gt;; Unity &lt;<a href=\"mailto:unity@futurasa.co.za\" title=\"mailto:unity@futurasa.co.za\">unity@futurasa.co.za</a>&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b>&nbsp;URGENT&nbsp;FAR0217&nbsp;RO Swika Foods t/a Wimpy Highveld Witbank</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Dear Maud Goxo</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">We have been advised that you are the contact person for this store.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Kindly note that we need to do updates from January 2021 and have been advised by our Client Relationship Manager Gail, <span style=\"background:yellow\">that staff did not work for January 2021 to April 2021</span>, and that all members are aware that no deductions were made from their salaries for this period.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">We will need to <span style=\"background:yellow\">charge for costs to administer the fund for these 4 months</span>, and Gail has confirmed that we will not require signed break in service forms nor proof of member communication.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">To start with updates from <span style=\"background:yellow\">January 2021, we need to know who left your service from 1/1/2021 to 1/5/2021</span>, as the <span style=\"background:yellow\">schedules received May 2021 has 11 members less than the last schedule submitted (March 2020) which has 28 members</span>.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Kindly have a look at the list of <span style=\"background:yellow\">28 members in 2020, and the list at May 2021 of 17</span> and <span style=\"background:yellow\">advise dates of leaving service, date of last contribution and the reason, resigned, dismissed etc. for the 11 missing members so that we can remove them at the correct dates and send claim forms to you for them.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">We await your urgent response.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Many Thanks</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Note: Please&nbsp;<b>do not send schedules and claim forms to personal email addresses</b>&nbsp;as it is only actioned from&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:unityeb@futurasa.co.za\" title=\"mailto:unityeb@futurasa.co.za\"><b>unityeb@futurasa.co.za</b></a></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Kind Regards</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Mymoena Kariem</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Senior Administrator</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"623\" style=\"width:467.45pt; border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"144\" rowspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:108.3pt; border:none; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:windowtext; text-decoration:none\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"130\" height=\"78\" id=\"Picture_x0020_9\" src=\"cid:image003.png@01DD15D8.22889AC0\" style=\"width:1.3583in; height:.8166in\"></span></a><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"479\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:359.15pt; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">phone:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;087 702 5904</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"479\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:359.15pt; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">mobile:&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">066 192 7247</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"479\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:359.15pt; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">fax:&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">086 565 4597</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"479\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:359.15pt; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-seri