tyle=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"> dismissed etc. so that we can remove the member at correct date and send claim forms to complete. (This member is not on the June 2021 list but is on the March 2020 list).</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">We await your urgent response.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Many Thanks</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Note: Please <b>do not send schedules and claim forms to personal email addresses</b> as it is only actioned from </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:unityeb@futurasa.co.za\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">unityeb@futurasa.co.za</span></b></a></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Kind Regards</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:#63BE60\">Mymoena Kariem</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-seri