thic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Kindly note that if a member was ill before leaving service then they may qualify for disability benefits if provided by the rules of the Fund. Please therefore always notify us immediately if the member was sick when notifying us of members who leave your service.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">If a MEMBER ceases to be employed by a PARTICIPATING EMPLOYER and, immediately afterwards starts working for another PARTICIPATING EMPLOYER <b>he will remain a MEMBER of the FUND. </b>In such event the MEMBER’S <b>membership will be deemed not to have ceased </b>and he will remain entitled to such benefits and on such conditions as provided for in the RULES. Claims submitted will not be processed by the Fund’s back office if a member immediately starts working for another employer that contributes to the same fund, as the fund sees this as an active member and therefore any new contributions will be added to the existing member record. Please mark the claim form accordingly in such events.</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><a name=\"_Hlk176529369\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Please inform the member to consult with their Financial Advisor for completion of options on the form if needed.</span></a></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"\"></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Note: It is important to submit claim forms when members leave your service, so that we can arrange for timeous payment.</span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></span></p><span style=\"\"></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Please</span></i></b><b><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"> be advised, due to the complexities of claim payments post 1 September 2024 – the turnaround time for all payments has been extended from 10 business days to 30 business days, providing all outstanding documentation has been received. </span></i></b><b><i><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></i></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></i></b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-