load. Please save these documents to your own folder for future use as this link will expire.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">Did you know that you can access all your retirement fund information online? To register, follow this link <a href=\"https://info.sanlam.co.za/s/t/l/663e25256714594cb3125104/d8ce53c7267196ca4a1da8f938d13d57\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:black\">https://www.sanlamonline.co.za/login/</span></a> or download the “Sanlam Portfolio” app from your app store. This powerful financial planning tool provides access to your retirement fund information online, so you can take charge of your retirement journey. </span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#4C4C4E\"><br><br></span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">The App is packed with many useful features like the retirement income calculator to help work out how much you need to save. You can also update your beneficiaries and request investment switches (if applicable), explore options to boost your retirement income, and much more!</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">If you have any queries, please speak to your employer, or call (or Whatsapp) the Sanlam Contact Centre on&nbsp; 0861 223 646.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#4C4C4E\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Please do not reply to this email.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Yours faithfully </span><br><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Retirement Fund Administration</span><br><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Sanlam Corporate</span></p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">email</span></strong></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">:</span></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"mailto:SanlamEB@sanlam.co.za\">SanlamEB@sanlam.co.za</a></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">WEB</span></strong></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">:</span></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://www.sanlam.co.za\">www.sanlam.co.za</a></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<br><br>&quot;Sanlam Corporate (SC) in its capacity as Fund Administrator merely performs administrative services with regard to the insured benefits of Fund members. The applicable Insurer, Sanlam Group Risk or any other registered Insurer as approved for any particular fund/sub-fund, is responsible for any underwriting or related decision and SC bears no liability in respect of any such decision.&quot;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNo