e </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Sanlam Unity Umbrella Fund</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">. To download your <strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">updated membership certificate</span></strong>, please click here: <a href=\"https://sc.sanlam.com/JzZ4mH\">https://sc.sanlam.com/JzZ4mH</a></span>. <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">You will need your <strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">ID or Passport number</span></strong> to complete the download. Kindly save these documents for your records.</span></p><p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Your Membership Number:</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">58302280</span></strong></p><p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Stay Connected</span></strong></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">As you are no longer part of your previous employers communication channels, please take the following steps to stay informed about your investment:</span></p><ul type=\"disc\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Register for online access: </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">If you have not already, sign up for<strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> Sanlam online member portal </span></strong>or<strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> Sanlam Portfolio app </span></strong>to manage your retirement details and access services like <strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Investment Switches, Two-Pot Emergency Savings Claims, and Beneficiary Updates</span></strong>. Register here: <a href=\"https://www.sanlamonline.co.za/login/\">https://www.sanlamonline.co.za/login/</a> or download the app from your app store.</span></li></ul><ul type=\"disc\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Update beneficiary nominations and information: </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Ensure your loved ones are taken care of by updating your beneficiary nomination details regularly, especially after life changes like marriage, divorce, birth or legal adoption of a child. The absence of this information may delay the payment of benefits to your loved ones. You can easily update this information online via the online member portal or the app by accessing the <strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Beneficiaries </span></strong>tile. </span></li></ul><ul type=\"disc\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Update your contact details:</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Please ensure we have your latest contact information. </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Contact the Fund Contact Centre to keep your details updated</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">.</span></li></ul><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">If you need help, <strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">WhatsApp or call</span></strong> the Sanlam Corporate Contact Centre at </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">0861 223 646</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">.</span></p><p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Please do not reply to this email.</span></strong></p><p><br><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Kind Regards</span><br><em><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Sanlam Corporate Administration Team</span></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">email</span></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">:</span></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"mailto:SanlamEB@sanlam.co.za\">SanlamEB@sanlam.co.za</a></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">WEB</span></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">:</span></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://www.sanlam.co.za\">www.sanlam.co.za</a></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>Please click on the following link for terms of use of this communication / <br>Klik asb. op die skakel vir die gebruiksbepalings van hierdie kommunikasie: <br><a href=\"https://www.sanlam.com/terms-of-use\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.sanlam.com/terms-of-use</a> </p></div></body></html>','2026-07-20 10:22:09',NULL,NULL),('AAMkAGFkYjAyZWRmLWExNmUtNDQxNS1hZmUxLTBmMjQ0MWFmOGRlZQBGAAAAAADbwHY7A9mQTImLgIF_ix5zBwC9fQ-VglzPQ5bb0eEZTHrKAAAAAAEMAAC9fQ-VglzPQ5bb0eEZTHrKAAb5Om5CAAA=','FW: 1510507 - Fw: RE: SANLAM UMBRELLA PENSION FUND: SANTOS HAVEN RETI