ns-serif; color:#4C4C4E\"><br><br></span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">The App is packed with many useful features like the retirement income calculator to help work out how much you need to save. You can also update your beneficiaries and request investment switches (if applicable), explore options to boost your retirement income, and much more!</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">If you have any queries, please speak to your employer, or call (or Whatsapp) the Sanlam Contact Centre on&nbsp; 0861 223 646.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#4C4C4E\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Please do not reply to this email.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Yours faithfully </span><br><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Retirement Fund Administration</span><br><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Sanlam Corporate</span></p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">email</span></strong></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">:</span></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot