=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Petrus Albertus Potgieter T/A Motsomi Safaris</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Fund Code</span></strong></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">:</span></strong></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">1510804</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Good day</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">We have received a manual benefit claim form for the above member and have noticed that the old claim form was completed.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">With the recent implementation of the two-pot retirement legislation, a new claim form has been introduced to make it easier for members to understand what information is required from them. This includes straightforward payment instructions for each pot.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">A personalized member claim form is accessible on the employer portal for each member and is compulsory to use for all claims with an exit date after 31/08/2024.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Please complete and submit this compulsory claim form via the employer portal.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Should you need assistance in submitting the claim on RFW, please contact the Web team on: <a href=\"mailto:scdigitalsupport@sanlam.co.za\">scdigitalsupport@sanlam.co.za</a> alternatively call them on 086 072 7867.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Kind regards&n