d, then please send an email saying no changes</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">. </span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; background:yellow\">2.Alternatively, please send us your Excel list in the required format.</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; background:yellow\">3. IMPORTANT<span style=\"color:#4472C4\"> </span>NOTE: </span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; background:yellow\"></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; background:yellow\">We herewith remind that the FSCA requires for all Provident Funds to have the minimum information on record for members, per below:</span></b></p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"799\" style=\"width:599.4pt; border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr style=\"height:85.0pt\"><td width=\"77\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width:57.45pt; border:double windowtext 2.25pt; border-left:none; background:#666699; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height:85.0pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:#FFC000\">Member Name</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; color:#FFC000\"></span></b></p></td><td width=\"65\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width:48.65pt; border:double windowtext 2.25pt; border-left:none; background:#666699; padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height:85.0pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:#FFC000\">Member Surname</span></b></p></td><td width=\"54\" style=\"width:40.15pt; border:double 