></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F497D\"><a href=\"http://www.piecity.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#0563C1\">www.piecity.co.za</span></a></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F497D\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F497D\">The information transmitted is intended only for the person or entity to which it is addressed and may contain confidential and/or privileged material and Pie City (Pty) Ltd (\'Pie City\') retains the copyright and intellectual property in this e-mail. Any review, disclosure, copying, retransmission, dissemination or other use of, or taking of any action in reliance upon this information by persons or entities other than the intended recipient is prohibited. If an addressing or transmission error has misdirected this e-mail; please notify Pie city immediately by electronic communication to <a href=\"mailto:info@piecity.co.za\"><span style=\"color:#0563C1\">info@piecity.co.za</span></a> and/or telephonically at 011-4524885&nbsp; and then delete this email. If you are </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F497D\">not the intended recipient you may not use, disclose, distribute, copy, print or rely on this e-mail. The use and/or contents of this e-mail are intended for Pie City business purposes only. Views and opinions expressed in this e-mail are those of the sender unless clearly stated as those of Pie City. Pie City accepts no liability whatsoever for any loss or damages whatsoever and howsoever incurred, or suffered, resulting, or arising, from the use of this email or its attachments. The Company does not warrant the integrity of this email or that it is freeof errors, viruses, interception or interference.</span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"></span></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><div><div style=\"border:none; border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Natasha Brijh <br><b>Sent:</b> Thursday, 18 June 2026 09:25<br><b>To:</b> \'Gail Le Roux\' &lt;gail@futurasa.co.za&gt;; \'Unity EB\' &lt;unityeb@futurasa.co.za&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> \'Lesly Rabinowitz\' &lt;lesly@matusonassociates.co.za&gt;; \'Lance Schapiro\' &lt;lschapiro@matusonassociates.co.za&gt;; Jonathan Berthold &lt;jonathan@piecity.co.za&gt;; \'Andrew Muzamhindo\' &lt;andrew@matusonassociates.co.za&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> RE: Devpret &amp; Pie City in Business Rescue-Sanlam -FAR0100</span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Morning Gail</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Your urgent response is requested .</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><div><div style=\"border:none; border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Natasha Brijh <br><b>Sent:</b> Wednesday, 17 June 2026 12:18<br><b>To:</b> Gail Le Roux &lt;<a href=\"mailto:gail@futurasa.co.za\">gail@futurasa.co.za</a>&gt;; Unity EB &lt;<a href=\"mailto:unityeb@futurasa.co.za\">unityeb@futurasa.co.za</a>&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Lesly Rabinowitz &lt;<a href=\"mailto:lesly@matusonassociates.co.za\">lesly@matusonassociates.co.za</a>&gt;; Lance Schapiro &lt;<a href=\"mailto:lschapiro@matusonassociates.co.za\">lschapiro@matusonassociates.co.za</a>&gt;; Jonathan Berthold &lt;<a href=\"mailto:jonathan@piecity.co.za\">jonathan@piecity.co.za</a>&gt;; Andrew Muzamhindo &lt;<a href=\"mailto:andrew@matusonassociates.co.za\">andrew@matusonassociates.co.za</a>&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> RE: Devpret &amp; Pie City in Business Rescue-Sanlam -FAR0100</span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Good day , Gail</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">We are awaiting your urgent response.</p><div><div style=\"border:none; border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Natasha Brijh <br><b>Sent:</b> Friday, 12 June 2026 17:45<br><b>To:</b> Unity EB &lt;<a href=\"mailto:unityeb@futurasa.co.za\">unityeb@futurasa.co.za</a>&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> FW: Devpret &amp; Pie City in Business Rescue</span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><div><div style=\"border:none; border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Lesly Rabinowitz &lt;<a href=\"mailto:lesly@matusonassociates.co.za\">lesly@matusonassociates.co.za</a>&gt; <br><b>Sent:</b> Thursday, 11 June 2026 11:44<br><b>To:</b> <a href=\"mailto:gail@futurasa.co.za\">gail@futurasa.co.za</a><br><b>Cc:</b> Natasha Brijh &lt;<a href=\"mailto:natasha@piecity.co.za\">natasha@piecity.co.za</a>&gt;; Jonathan Berthold &lt;<a href=\"mailto:jonathan@piecity.co.za\">jonathan@piecity.co.za</a>&gt;; Lance Schapiro &lt;<a href=\"mailto:lschapiro@matusonassociates.co.za\">lschapiro@matusonassociates.co.za</a>&gt;; Andrew Muzamhindo &lt;<a href=\"mailto:andrew@matusonassociates.co.za\">andrew@matusonassociates.co.za</a>&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> Devpret &amp; Pie City in Business Rescue</span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Dear Gail</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">As you are aware Devpret Pty Ltd and Pie City Pty Ltd were placed in business rescue on 26 May 2026 (see documentation attached hereto).</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Lance Schapiro was appointed as the business rescue practitioner (“ BRP”) on 26 May 2026.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">The BRP proceeded with an immediate and accelerated sales process and was anticipating the sale of certain stores as a going concern as well as the transfer of the staff by way of a S197 process.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Because of the timing of this sales process, the BRP is still in the process of concluding possible sales, however nothing, to date, has been finalized. At this stage we have no finality as to which stores will be closed and employees retrenched and which employees will be or might be transferred in terms of a S197 process.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Given the timing of this matter, would it be possible to waive the required one month’s notice, and make the payment on 30 June 2026?</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">I await your response.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Yours faithfully</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Lesly Rabinowitz.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">011 7287166</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><style>\r\n<!--\r\np\r\n	{font-family:\"Century Gothic\";\r\n	font-size:7}\r\n-->\r\n</style><p style=\"color:grey\">The contents of this e-mail and any accompanying documentation are confidential and any use thereof, in whatever form, by anyone other than the addressee is strictly prohibited. Should you receive a message not intended for your use, please contact the sender, and delete the message without delay. Any views expressed in this message are those of the individual sender. Although the company has taken all reasonable precautions to ensure that this e-mail is virus free, the company accepts no liability for any damage caused by any virus transmitted by this e-mail. </p></body></html>','2026-06-22 18:18:24',NULL,NULL),('AAMkAGFkYjAyZWRmLWExNmUtNDQxNS1hZmUxLTBmMjQ0MWFmOGRlZQBGAAAAAADbwHY7A9mQTImLgIF_ix5zBwC9fQ-VglzPQ5bb0eEZTHrKAAAAAAEMAAC9fQ-VglzPQ5bb0eEZTHrKAAbPGFoAAAA=','FW: 1510665 - Zamori 194 (Pty) Ltd t/a Wimpy Bethlehem ','Merril Fennessy','merril@futurasa.co.za','<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Microsoft Word 15 (filtered medium)\"><style>\r\n<!--\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:\"Cambria Math\"}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:Calibri}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:Aptos}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:\"Century Gothic\"}\r\np.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal\r\n	{margin:0cm;\r\n	font-size:11.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Aptos\",serif}\r\na:link, span.MsoHyperlink\r\n	{color:#467886;\r\n	text-decoration:underline}\r\nspan.EmailStyle19\r\n	{font-family:\"Aptos\",serif;\r\n	color:windowtext}\r\n.MsoChpDefault\r\n	{font-size