tyle=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\"><br><br></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:small\">Dear Mahlathini Moakamela</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:small\"><strong>SANLAM UNITY UMBRELLA FUND</strong></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:x-small\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:small\">We are </span><span style=\"font-size:small\">pleased</span><span style=\"font-size:small\"> to welcome you as a <strong>Paid-up</strong> member of the </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:small\">Sanlam Unity Umbrella Fund</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:x-small\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:small; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">.</span><span style=\"font-size:small\"> </span></span></span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:\'Aptos\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:x-small\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:small\">To download your <strong>updated membership certificate</strong><strong></strong>, please click here: https://sc.sanlam.com/qyhO8k</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:small\">. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:x-small\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:small\">You will need your <strong>ID or Passport number</strong> to complete the download. Kindly save these documents for your records.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:small; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Your Membership Number:</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:small; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-size:small; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>57748882</strong></span><br></span></p><p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:small; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Stay Connected</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\"><br></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:small; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">As you are no longer part of your previous employers communication channels, please take the following steps to stay informed about your investment:</span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0cm\"><li data-level=\"1\" data-list=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:x-small\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:small\"><strong>Register for online access: </strong>If you have not already, sign up for<strong> Sanlam online member portal </strong>or<strong> Sanlam Portfolio app </strong>to manage your retirement details and access services like <strong>Investment Switches, Two-Pot Emergency Savings Claims, and Beneficiary Updates</strong>. Register here: https://www.sanlamonline.co.za/login/ or download the app from your app store.</span></span></span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:x-small\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:small\"><strong>Update beneficiary nominations and information: </strong>Ensure your loved ones are taken care o</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:x-small\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:small\">f by updating your beneficiary nomination details regularly, especially after life changes like marriage, divorce, birth or legal adoption of a child. The absence of this information may delay the payment of benefits to your loved ones. You can easily update this information online via the online member portal or the app by accessing the </span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:x-small\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:small\"><strong>Beneficiaries </strong></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:x-small\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:small\">tile. </span></span></span></span></li></ul><ul><li><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:small; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Update your contact details:</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:x-small\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:small\">Please ensure we have your latest contact information.</span><span style=\"font-size:small; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"> </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:\'Aptos\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:small\">Contact the Fund Contact Centre </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:small\">to keep your details updated</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:x-small\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:small; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">.</span></span></span></span></span></li></ul><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:\'Aptos\',sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:x-small\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:small\">If you need help, <strong>WhatsApp or call</strong> the Sanlam Corporate Contact Centre at </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:small; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><strong>0861 223 646</strong>.</span></p><p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:small; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Please do not reply to this email.</span></strong></p><p><br><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:small\">Kind Regards</span><br><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:small\"><em>Sanlam Corporate Administration Team</em></span><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><table><tbody><tr><td><span style=\"font-size:10pt; font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">email</span></td><td><span style=\"font-size:10pt; font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">:</span></td><td><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:10pt\">SanlamEB@sanlam.co.za</span></td></tr><tr><td><span style=\"font-size:10pt; font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">WEB</span></td><td><span style=\"font-size:10pt; font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">:</span></td><td><span style=\"font-size:10pt; font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://www.sanlam.co.za\">www.sanlam.co.za</a></span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><br>Please click on the following link for terms of use of this communication / <br>Klik asb. op die skakel vir die gebruiksbepalings van hierdie kommunikasie: <br><a href=\"https://www.sanlam.com/terms-of-use\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.sanlam.com/terms-of-use</a> <br></body></html>','2026-07-31 20:20:31',NULL,NULL),('AAMkAGFkYjAyZWRm