family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:nhlayisi.mangwani@pfa.org.za\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">nhlayisi.mangwani@pfa.org.za</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><br><b>Subject:</b> Sanlam Umbrella Fund FAR0242</span></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">To whom it my concern</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Attached is a spreadsheet of how the monies paid into FAR0242&nbsp; must be allocated.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Mama Carina\'s has been sold and the new owner Lanie took over on 1 March 2025.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I have kept on paying the fund up to the end of November 2025.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">H Janse van Vuuren started working for COUNTRY PIE and from 1 May2025 the factory was paying her monthly contribution.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">From 1 December 2025 Lanie paid M Sibanyoni , A Masuku ,and Betty Chauke \'s contribution while I keep on paying KE Masuku\'s contribution.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Maria Sibanyoni absconded from her work according to Lanie the&nbsp;end of December 2025.I have no knowledge of the reasons or if there were any documentation involved.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I want to state that since the staff members became members of the Sanlam Umbrella Fund not a single&nbsp;cent was deducted from their pay.The employer paid the amount in full and even more than required.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Will you please allocate the monies paid to the respective members.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Lanie sold the shopand from 1 April 2026&nbsp; there is a new owner.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Hope you find the above in order .</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Kind regards</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Carina Hanekom</span></p></div></body></html>','2026-07-31 12:07:45',NULL,NULL),('AAMkAGFkYjAyZWRmLWExNmUtNDQxNS1hZmUxLTBmMjQ0MWFmOGRlZQBGAAAAAADbwHY7A9mQTImLgIF_ix5zBwC9fQ-VglzPQ5bb0eEZTHrKAAAAAAEMAAC9fQ-VglzPQ5bb0eEZTHrKAAcADIHcAAA=','Quarantine report from 31/07/2026 2:00 PM for unityeb@futurasa.co.za','WatchGuard','no-reply@watchguard.com','<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"></head><body><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light only\"><meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light only\"><meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\"><style type=\"text/css\">\r\n<!--\r\n.footer\r\n	{margin:12px 0px}\r\n.footer-third-line\r\n	{font-size:13px}\r\ntd, a, span\r\n	{border-collapse:collapse}\r\n-->\r\n</style><style type=\"text/css\">\r\n<!--\r\n.table-width\r\n	{width:100%!important;\r\n	min-width:580px!important}\r\n.smaller-table-width\r\n	{width:100%!important;\r\n	min-width:580px!important}\r\n.table-outer-width\r\n	{width:100%!important;\r\n	min-width:58