5.0pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Dear Client,</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Please find attached the claim forms for M Magadlela and the update May 2026,please confirm if in order.</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Passwords to follow.</span></b><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">With the introduction of the 2 Pot legislation on 01/09/24, the exit process has become more complicated. </span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Thanks for notifying us of the <b>Retirement </b>for above member.</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">There are 2 documents that must now be completed:</span><u></u><u></u></p><ol start=\"1\" type=\"a\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">the new out-of-service form and </span><u></u><u></u></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">a basic form which is also signed by the member. </span><u></u><u></u></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Both documents must be sent to </span><a href=\"mailto:unityeb@futurasa.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:#0563c1\">unityeb@futurasa.co.za</span></b></a><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">by indicating fund code and initials and surname in the Subject Line. </span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;(Sanlam no longer accepts old forms). <b>Please refer to the basic form to see the amount which can be taken in cash if any, and which amount must be preserved.</b></span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></b><u></u><u></u></p><ol start=\"3\" type=\"a\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">The following documents must also be submitted with the claim forms:</span><u></u><u></u></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">1)Identity document</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2)Bank Statement in member’s own name</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3)SARS Notice of registration which provides the member’s full name</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; and surname, identity number and tax number.</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Please send the completed forms indicating the last contribution date &nbsp;of <b>31 July 2026</b> to </span><a href=\"mailto:unityeb@futurasa.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:#0563c1\">unityeb@futurasa.co.za</span></b></a><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black; background:yellow\">Kindly note that if a member was ill before leaving service then they may qualify for disability benefits if provided by the rules of the Fund. Please therefore always notify us immediately if the member was sick when notifying us of members who leave your service</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">.</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">If a MEMBER ceases to be employed by a PARTICIPATING EMPLOYER and, immediately afterwards starts working for another PARTICIPATING EMPLOYER <b>he will remain a MEMBER of the FUND. </b>In such event the MEMBER’S <b>membership will be deemed not to have ceased </b>and he will remain entitled to such benefits and on such conditions as provided for in the RULES. <span style=\"color:black\">Claims submitted will not be processed by the Fund’s back office if a member immediately starts working for another employer that contributes to the same fund, as the fund sees this as an active member and therefore any new contributions will be added to the existing member record. <span style=\"background:yellow\">Please mark the claim form accordingly in such events.</span></span></span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black; background:yellow\">&nbsp;</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"m_-4131157407547643693_m_-3804229776316472604_m_852193003303792\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black; background:yellow\">Please inform the member to consult with their Financial Advisor for completion of options on the form if needed</span></a><span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">.</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Note: It is important to submit claim forms when members leave your service, so that we can arrange for timeous payment</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">.</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Please </span></i></b><b><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">be advised, due to the complexities of claim payments post 1 September 2024 – the turnaround time for all payments has been extended from 10 business days to 30 business days, providing all outstanding documentation has been received. </span></i></b><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><i><span lang=\"EN-US\" 