=\"MsoNormal\">Please confirm.<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">I also need for you to send me retirement forms for member 47387953 Marildia Magadlela retiring effective 31 July 2026.<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">William<u></u><u></u></p></blockquote></blockquote></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></body></html>','2026-07-31 09:08:58',NULL,NULL),('AAMkAGFkYjAyZWRmLWExNmUtNDQxNS1hZmUxLTBmMjQ0MWFmOGRlZQBGAAAAAADbwHY7A9mQTImLgIF_ix5zBwC9fQ-VglzPQ5bb0eEZTHrKAAAAAAEMAAC9fQ-VglzPQ5bb0eEZTHrKAAcADIHhAAA=','RE: Sanlam Umbrella Fund FAR0242 Schedules /Sibanyoni claim checking and will advise','Merril Fennessy','merril@futurasa.co.za','<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Microsoft Word 15 (filtered medium)\"><style>\r\n<!--\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:Wingdings}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:\"Cambria Math\"}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:Calibri}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:Aptos}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:\"Century Gothic\"}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:\"Aptos Narrow\"}\r\np.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal\r\n	{margin:0cm;\r\n	font-size:12.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif}\r\na:link, span.MsoHyperlink\r\n	{color:#467886;\r\n	text-decoration:underline}\r\np.MsoListParagraph, li.MsoListParagraph, div.MsoListParagraph\r\n	{margin-top:0cm;\r\n	margin-right:0cm;\r\n	margin-bottom:0cm;\r\n	margin-left:36.0pt;\r\n	font-size:12.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif}\r\nspan.EmailStyle19\r\n	{font-family:\"Century Gothic\",sans-serif;\r\n	color:windowtext}\r\n.MsoChpDefault\r\n	{font-size:10.0pt}\r\n@page WordSection1\r\n	{margin:72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt}\r\ndiv.WordSection1\r\n	{}\r\nol\r\n	{margin-bottom:0cm}\r\nul\r\n	{margin-bottom:0cm}\r\n-->\r\n</style></head><body lang=\"EN-ZA\" link=\"#467886\" vlink=\"#96607D\" style=\"word-wr