>To:</b> Unity &lt;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:unity@futurasa.co.za\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">unity@futurasa.co.za</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Gail Le Roux &lt;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:gail@futurasa.co.za\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">gail@futurasa.co.za</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&gt;; Lanie Van Schalkwyk &lt;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:Lanievs@gmail.com\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Lanievs@gmail.com</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&gt;; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:mymoenakariem@sanlam.co.za\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">mymoenakariem@sanlam.co.za</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:nhlayisi.mangwani@pfa.org.za\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">nhlayisi.mangwani@pfa.org.za</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><br><b>Subject:</b> Sanlam Umbrella Fund FAR0242</span></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">To whom it my concern</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Attached is a spreadsheet of how the monies paid into FAR0242&nbsp; must be allocated.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Mama Carina\'s has been sold and the new owner Lanie took over on 1 March 2025.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I have kept on paying the fund up to the end of November 2025.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">H Janse van Vuuren started working for COUNTRY PIE and from 1 May2025 the factory was paying her monthly contribution.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">From 1 December 2025 Lanie paid M Sibanyoni , A Masuku ,and Betty Chauke \'s contribution while I keep on paying KE Masuku\'s contribution.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Maria Sibanyoni absconded from her work according to Lanie the&nbsp;end of December 2025.I have no knowledge of the reasons or if there were any documentation involved.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I want to state that since the staff members became members of the Sanlam Umbrella Fund not a single&nbsp;cent was deducted from their pay.The employer paid the amount in full and even more than required.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Will you please allocate the monies paid to the respective members.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Lanie sold the shopand from 1 April 2026&nbsp; there is a new owner.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Hope you find the above in order .</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Kind regards</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Carina Hanekom</span></p></div></body></html>','2026-07-31 09:09:08',NULL,NULL),('AAMkAGFkYjAyZWRmLWExNmUtNDQxNS1hZmUxLTBmMjQ0MWFmOGRlZQBGAAAAAADbwHY7A9mQTImLgIF_ix5zBwC9fQ-VglzPQ5bb0eEZTHrKAAAAAAEMAAC9fQ-VglzPQ5bb0eEZTHrKAAcADIHiAAA=','RE: Sanlam Umbrella Fund FAR0242 Schedules /Sibanyoni claim Monthly Reporting Feedback ignore my previous email ','Merril Fennessy','merril@futurasa.co.za','<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Microsoft Word 15 (filtered medium)\"><style>\r\n<!--\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:Wingdings}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:\"Cambria Math\"}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:Calibri}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:Aptos}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:\"Century Gothic\"}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:\"Aptos Narrow\"}\r\np.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal\r\n	{margin:0cm;\r\n	font-size:12.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif}\r\na:link, span.MsoHyperlink\r\n	{color:#467886;\r\n	text-decoration:underline}\r\np.MsoListParagraph, li.MsoListParagraph, div.MsoListParagraph\r\n	{margin-top:0cm;\r\n	margin-right:0cm;\r\n	margin-bottom:0cm;\r\n	margin-left:36.0pt;\r\n	font-size:12.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif}\r\nspan.EmailStyle21\r\n	{font-family:\"Century Gothic\",sans-serif;\r\n	color:windowtext}\r\n.MsoChpDefault\r\n	{font-size:10.0pt}\r\n@page WordSection1\r\n	{margin:72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt}\r\ndiv.WordSection1\r\n	{}\r\nol\r\n	{margin-bottom:0cm}\r\nul\r\n	{margin-bottom:0cm}\r\n-->\r\n</style></head><body lang=\"EN-ZA\" link=\"#467886\" vlink=\"#96607D\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Morning</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">So employer paid in excess of the amount due.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">So can that please be added to Employer AVC.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><div><div><div><div><div><div><div style=\"border:none; border-bottom:solid #E5E5E5 1.0pt; padding:0cm 0cm 19.0pt 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">Please note that no documents should be forwarded to a personal inbox or to that of any other individual, but rather to the central dispatch e-mail address <a href=\"mailto:Unity@futurasa.co.za\"><span style=\"color:blue\">Unity@futurasa.co.za</span></a>&nbsp; This process allows us to keep a proper track record and audit trail of all documents received and reduces the risk of not processing important information timeously.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:20.65pt; background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black; background:white\">Regards</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:20.65pt; background:white\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:#63BE60; background:white\">Merril Fennessy</span></b></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black; background:white\">Client Relations Manager Sanlam Unity Umbrella Fund</span></p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:white; border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"130\" rowspan=\