E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Mymoena Kariem <br><b>Sent:</b> Friday, July 24, 2026 11:44 AM<br><b>To:</b> Merril Fennessy &lt;<a href=\"mailto:merril@futurasa.co.za\">merril@futurasa.co.za</a>&gt;; Unity &lt;<a href=\"mailto:unity@futurasa.co.za\">unity@futurasa.co.za</a>&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Lorraine Olivier &lt;<a href=\"mailto:lorraine@futurasa.co.za\">lorraine@futurasa.co.za</a>&gt;; Unity EB &lt;<a href=\"mailto:unityeb@futurasa.co.za\">unityeb@futurasa.co.za</a>&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> Sanlam Umbrella Fund FAR0242 Schedules /Sibanyoni claim</span></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Dear Merril</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Thanks for the feedback provided. This method of not querying with the Employer is not in line with our Practice Note/procedure on reconciliations, and it will be done as a special request, and as approved by you as the CRM.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Our standard procedure is to query %’s &nbsp;that are not in line with the agreed rules, and quite often we find that the client made an error and will then send an amended schedule etc.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,s