turasa.co.za</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&gt;; Lanie Van Schalkwyk &lt;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:Lanievs@gmail.com\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Lanievs@gmail.com</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&gt;; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:mymoenakariem@sanlam.co.za\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">mymoenakariem@sanlam.co.za</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:nhlayisi.mangwani@pfa.org.za\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">nhlayisi.mangwani@pfa.org.za</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><br><b>Subject:</b> Sanlam Umbrella Fund FAR0242</span></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">To whom it my concern</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Attached is a spreadsheet of how the monies paid into FAR0242&nbsp; must be allocated.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Mama Carina\'s has been sold and the new owner Lanie took over on 1 March 2025.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I have kept on paying the fund up to the end of November 2025.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">H Janse van Vuuren started working for COUNTRY PIE and from 1 May2025 the factory was paying her monthly contribution.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">From 1 December 2025 Lanie paid M Sibanyoni , A Masuku ,and Betty Chauke \'s contribution while I keep on paying KE Masuku\'s contribution.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Maria Sibanyoni absconded from her work according to Lanie the&nbsp;end of December 2025.I have no knowledge of the reasons or if there were any documentation involved.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I want to state that since the staff members became members of the Sanlam Umbrella Fund not a single&nbsp;cent was deducted from their pay.The employer paid the amount in full and even more than required.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Will you please allocate the monies paid to the respective members.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Lanie sold the shopand from 1 April 2026&nbsp; there is a new owner.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Hope you find the above in order .</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Kind regards</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Carina Hanekom</span></p></div></body></html>','2026-07-31 09:10:57',NULL,NULL),('AAMkAGFkYjAyZWRmLWExNmUtNDQxNS1hZmUxLTBmMjQ0MWFmOGRlZQBGAAAAAADbwHY7A9mQTImLgIF_ix5zBwC9fQ-VglzPQ5bb0eEZTHrKAAAAAAEMAAC9fQ-VglzPQ5bb0eEZTHrKAAcADIHjAAA=','RE: Isaac Radebe (55075443) REF: wf_20927368 FAR0277 H P Boya CC T/A Steers Fishaways and Debonairs Highlands moved to Default Pai