> <a href=\"mailto:stephan@futurasa.co.za\"><span style=\"color:#0563C1\">stephan@futurasa.co.za</span></a></span><span style=\"\"></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Futura SA is a Level 1 B-BBEE contributor, committed to transformation and inclusive growth.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:8.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">Disclaimer: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:8.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">Futura SA Administrators (Pty) Ltd is an authorized Financial Services Provider licensed by the Financial Sector Conduct Authority in terms of the FAIS Act. License Number 18287 and a licensed Section 13B Administrator number 24/760. This transmission is confidential and intended solely for the person or organization to whom it is addressed.&nbsp;It may contain privileged and confidential information.&nbsp; If you are not the intended recipient, you should not copy, distribute or take any action in reliance on it. If you have received this transmission in error, please notify us immediately by e-mail at <a href=\"mailto:info@futurasa.co.za\"><span style=\"color:#0563C1\">info@futurasa.co.za</span></a>.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\"></span></p></div></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><div><div style=\"border:none; border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Grechen Lieben (SC) &lt;Grechen.Lieben@sanlam.co.za&gt; <br><b>Sent:</b> 31 July 2026 12:12<br><b>To:</b> Stephan de Waal &lt;stephan@futurasa.co.za&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Fund Secretariat SUF &lt;FundSecretariatSUF@sanlam.co.za&gt;; sgradministration (SEB) &lt;sgradministration@sanlam.co.za&gt;; Unity &lt;unity@futurasa.co.za&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> SANLAM UNITY UMBRELLA FUND-OUTSTANDING CONTRIBUTIONS-TEXCARE LAUNDRY &amp; DRY CLEANING SPECIALIST (PTY) LTD-EMP233</span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"color:#203864\">Dear Stephan</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#203864\">This client is on the 13A report for </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">outstanding contributions. I will appreciate it if you can investigate and if the contributions are in fact outstanding phone the client and discuss the urgent e-mail below as well as the attached letters with the employer before you forward it to them. Please assist them where possible. </span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">Kindly also refer to the attached letters the consequences as well as FSCA communication and discuss this with the client please? The FSCA is now publishing the names of employers who does not comply on a quarterly basis, and we need to report on this to them monthly.</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">Dear Client </span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#1F4E79\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#163E64\">We have been advised that the monthly contributions for this participating employer are in arrears since May 2026 which is more than 2 months.&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#163E64\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">Due to the changes in legislation , the Board of Trustees decided to suspend participation.</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">Please find attached correspondence explaining the consequences for you, the Participating Employer and the members</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:red\">. <b>Risk cover may have ceased</b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#2F5597\">, </span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">if a claim would arise during this period of non-payment of contributions, we will not be liable to pay this claim and as a result the claim would be declined.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#163E64\">Should we not receive any feedback by<b> 7 August 2026</b> we will start with the termination of participation process and proceed to report the non-payment of contributions to the FSCA and the relevant authorities.</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">We also need confirmation that you distributed the attached member communication to all members</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">. <b>Should we not receive confirmation the fund will contact the members directly per SMS to inform them of the outstanding contributions.</b></span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"\">Kind regards</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-ZA\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#0075C9\">Grechen Lieben</span></b><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt; line-height:105%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:105%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:gray\">Fund Secretariat Administrator (Learner)</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt; line-height:105%\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:105%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#333E48\">Sanlam Corporate: Umbrella Solutions</span></b><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt; line-height:105%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:105%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:gray\">Sanlam Head Office, 2 Strand Road, Bellville, Cape Town, 7530<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.05pt\">&nbsp; </span>| <span style=\"letter-spacing:-.05pt\">&nbsp;</span>PO Box 1, Sanlamhof, 7532, South Africa</span><span lang=\"EN-ZA\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:14.0pt\"><spa