p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I have kept on paying the fund up to the end of November 2025.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">H Janse van Vuuren started working for COUNTRY PIE and from 1 May2025 the factory was paying her monthly contribution.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">From 1 December 2025 Lanie paid M Sibanyoni , A Masuku ,and Betty Chauke \'s contribution while I keep on paying KE Masuku\'s contribution.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Maria Sibanyoni absconded from her work according to Lanie the&nbsp;end of December 2025.I have no knowledge of the reasons or if there were any documentation involved.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I want to state that since the staff members became members of the Sanlam Umbrella Fund not a single&nbsp;cent was deducted from their pay.The employer paid the amount in full and even more than required.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Will you please allocate the monies paid to the respective members.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Lanie sold the shopand from 1 April 2026&nbsp; there is a new owner.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Hope you find the above in order .</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Kind regards</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Carina Hanekom</span></p></div></bo