if\">nhlayisi.mangwani@pfa.org.za</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><br><b>Subject:</b> Sanlam Umbrella Fund FAR0242</span></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">To whom it my concern</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Attached is a spreadsheet of how the monies paid into FAR0242&nbsp; must be allocated.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Mama Carina\'s has been sold and the new owner Lanie took over on 1 March 2025.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I have kept on paying the fund up to the end of November 2025.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">H Janse van Vuuren started working for COUNTRY PIE and from 1 May2025 the factory was paying her monthly contribution.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">From 1 December 2025 Lanie paid M Sibanyoni , A Masuku ,and Betty Chauke \'s contribution while I keep on paying KE Masuku\'s contribution.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Maria Sibanyoni absconded from her work according to Lanie the&nbsp;end of December 2025.I have no knowledge of the reasons or if there were any documentation involved.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">I want to state that since the staff members became members of the Sanlam Umbrella Fund not a single&nbsp;cent was deducted from their pay.The employer paid the amount in full and even more than required.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Will you please allocate the monies paid to the respective members.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Lanie sold the shopand from 1 April 2026&nbsp; there is a new owner.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Hope you find the above in order .</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Kind regards</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Carina Hanekom</span></p></div></body></html>','2026-07-31 11:37:45',NULL,NULL),('AAMkAGFkYjAyZWRmLWExNmUtNDQxNS1hZmUxLTBmMjQ0MWFmOGRlZQBGAAAAAADbwHY7A9mQTImLgIF_ix5zBwC9fQ-VglzPQ5bb0eEZTHrKAAAAAAEMAAC9fQ-VglzPQ5bb0eEZTHrKAAcADIHYAAA=','RE: AGR0116	Anthonie Christoffel Lombard T/A AC Lombard en Seun','Theuns Botha','theuns@futurasa.co.za','<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Microsoft Word 15 (filtered medium)\"><style>\r\n<!--\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:\"Cambria Math\"}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:Calibri}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:Aptos}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:\"Century Gothic\"}\r\np.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal\r\n	{margin:0cm;\r\n	font-size:11.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Aptos\",sans-serif}\r\na:link, span.MsoHyperlink\r\n	{color:#467886;\r\n	text-decoration:underline}\r\nspan.EmailStyle19\r\n	{font-family:\"Century Gothic\",sans-serif;\r\n	color:windowtext}\r\n.MsoChpDefault\r\n	{font-size:10.0pt}\r\n@page WordSection1\r\n	{margin:72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt 72.0pt}\r\ndiv.WordSection1\r\n	{}\r\n-->\r\n</style></head><body lang=\"EN-ZA\" link=\"#467886\" vlink=\"#96607D\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">