 number 24/760. This transmission is confidential and intended solely for the person or organization to whom it is addressed.&nbsp;It may contain privileged and confidential information.&nbsp; If you are not the intended recipient, you should not copy, distribute or take any action in reliance on it. If you have received this transmission in error, please notify us immediately by e-mail at </span><u><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:blue; background:white\"><a href=\"mailto:info@futurasa.co.za\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:blue\">info@futurasa.co.za</span></a></span></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><div id=\"divRplyFwdMsg\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\"> Grechen Lieben (SC) &lt;<a href=\"mailto:Grechen.Lieben@sanlam.co.za\">Grechen.Lieben@sanlam.co.za</a>&gt;<br><b>Sent:</b> Friday, July 31, 2026 12:11 PM<br><b>To:</b> Unity &lt;<a href=\"mailto:unity@futurasa.co.za\">unity@futurasa.co.za</a>&gt;<br><b>Cc:</b> Fund Secretariat SUF &lt;<a href=\"mailto:FundSecretariatSUF@sanlam.co.za\">FundSecretariatSUF@sanlam.co.za</a>&gt;; sgradministration (SEB) &lt;<a href=\"mailto:sgradministration@sanlam.co.za\">sgradministration@sanlam.co.za</a>&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> SANLAM UNITY UMBRELLA FUND-OUTSTANDING CONTRIBUTIONS-KIEJANE\'S MEAT COMPANY (PTY) LTD-1510767</span> </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:#203864\">Dear Merril</span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#203864\">This client is on the 13A report for </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">outstanding contributions. I will appreciate it if you can investigate and if the contributions are in fact outstanding phone the client and discuss the urgent e-mail below as well as the attached letters with the employer before you forward it to them. Please assist them where possible. </span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">Kindly also refer to the attached letters the consequences as well as FSCA communication and discuss this with the client please? The FSCA is now publishing the names of employers who does not comply on a quarterly basis, and we need to report on this to them monthly.</span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">Dear Client </span><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#163E64; background:yellow\">We have been advised that the monthly contributions for this participating employer are in arrears since May 2026 which is more than 2 months.&nbsp; </span><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#163E64; background:yellow\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">Due to the changes in legislation , the Board of Trustees decided to suspend participation.</span><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">Please find attached correspondence explaining the consequences for you, the Participating Employer and the members</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:red; background:yellow\">. <b>Risk cover may have ceased</b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#2F5597; background:yellow\">, </span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">if a claim would arise during this period of non-payment of contributions, we will not be liable to pay this claim and as a result the claim would be declined.</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#163E64; background:yellow\">Should we not receive any feedback by<b> 7 August 2026</b> we will start with the termination of participation process and proceed to report the non-payment of contributions to the FSCA and the relevant authorities.</span><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">We also need confirmation that you distributed the attached member communication to all members</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">. <b>Should we not receive confirmation the fund will contact the members directly per SMS to inform them of the outstanding contributions.</b></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Kind regards</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#0075C9\">Grechen Lieben</span></b></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt; line-height:105%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:105%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; colo