MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">June 2026 payment outstanding, </span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">July 2026 schedule and payment outstanding.</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;</span></span></u></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; background:yellow\">Queries on the payments received from ER</span></u></b><b><u><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></u></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">The payment of R29505.14 received on the 05/06/2026, &nbsp;credit that was left &nbsp;&nbsp;of </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black; background:yellow\">R 5625.70 was used to reconcile &nbsp;April 2026. </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">May 2026 has been &nbsp;finalised on the 24/07/2026,see below payments received, May 2026 cr balance,R0.00 </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"><img width=\"776\" heig