lor:#163E64; background:yellow\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">Due to the changes in legislation , the Board of Trustees decided to suspend participation.</span><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">Please find attached correspondence explaining the consequences for you, the Participating Employer and the members</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:red; background:yellow\">. <b>Risk cover may have ceased</b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#2F5597; background:yellow\">, </span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">if a claim would arise during this period of non-payment of contributions, we will not be liable to pay this claim and as a result the claim would be declined.</span></b><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#163E64; background:yellow\">Should we not receive any feedback by<b> 7 August 2026</b> we will start with the termination of participation process and proceed to report the non-payment of contributions to the FSCA and the relevant authorities.</span><span style=\"background:yellow\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">We also need confirmation that you distributed the attached member communication to all members</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79; background:yellow\">. <b>Should we not receive confirmation the fund will contact the members directly per SMS to inform them of the outstanding contributions.</b></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\">Kind regards</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#0075C9\">Grechen Lieben</span></b></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt; line-height:105%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:105%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:gray\">Fund Secretariat Administrator (Learner)</span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt; line-height:105%\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:105%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#333E48\">Sanlam Corporate: Umbrella Solutions</span></b></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt; line-height:105%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:105%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:gray\">Sanlam Head Office, 2 Strand Road, Bellville, Cape Town, 7530<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.05pt\">&nbsp; </span>| <span style=\"letter-spacing:-.05pt\">&nbsp;</span>PO Box 1, Sanlamhof, 7532, South Africa</span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:14.0pt\"><a href=\"http://www.sanlam.co.za/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:blue\">www.sanlam.co.za</span></b></a></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:blue\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.0pt; line-height:105%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"139\" height=\"32\" id=\"x_Picture_x0020_7\" src=\"cid:image006.png@01DD2332.63767EF0\" style=\"width:1.45in; height:.3333in\"></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#0075C9\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><span la