none\"> Grechen Lieben (SC) &lt;</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">Grechen.Lieben@sanlam.co.za</span><span style=\"color:black; font-weight:normal; text-decoration:none\">&gt;<br></span><span style=\"color:black; text-decoration:none\">Sent:</span><span style=\"color:black; font-weight:normal; text-decoration:none\"> Tuesday, June 9, 2026 9:33 AM<br></span><span style=\"color:black; text-decoration:none\">To:</span><span style=\"color:black; font-weight:normal; text-decoration:none\"> Unity &lt;</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">unity@futurasa.co.za</span><span style=\"color:black; font-weight:normal; text-decoration:none\">&gt;<br></span><span style=\"color:black; text-decoration:none\">Cc:</span><span style=\"color:black; font-weight:normal; text-decoration:none\"> Fund Secretariat SUF &lt;</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">FundSecretariatSUF@sanlam.co.za</span><span style=\"color:black; font-weight:normal; text-decoration:none\">&gt;; sgradministration (SEB) &lt;</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">sgradministration@sanlam.co.za</span><span style=\"color:black; font-weight:normal; text-decoration:none\">&gt;<br></span><span style=\"color:black; text-decoration:none\">Subject:</span><span style=\"color:black; font-weight:normal; text-decoration:none\"> SANLAM UNITY UMBRELLA FUND-OUTSTANDING CONTRIBUTIONS-PILANSBERG PREDATOR PARK CC-1511030</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; color:windowtext; font-weight:normal; text-decoration:none\"> </span></a></span></b></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:windowtext; text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;</span></a></p></div><p class=\"xmsonormal\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:windowtext; text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;</span></a></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span style=\"color:#203864\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#203864; text-decoration:none\">Dear Merril &amp; Gail</span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:windowtext; text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;</span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#203864\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#203864; text-decoration:none\">This client is on the 13A report for </span><span style=\"color:#1F4E79; text-decoration:none\">outstanding contributions. I will appreciate it if you can investigate and if the contributions are in fact outstanding phone the client and discuss the urgent e-mail below as well as the attached letters with the employer before you forward it to them. Please assist them where possible. </span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#1F4E79; text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;</span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#1F4E79; text-decoration:none\">Kindly also refer to the attached letters the consequences as well as FSCA communication and discuss this with the client please? The FSCA is now publishing the names of employers who does not comply on a quarterly basis, and we need to report on this to them monthly.</span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#1F4E79; text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;</span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#1F4E79; text-decoration:none\">Dear Client </span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#1F4E79\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#1F4E79; text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;</span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#163E64\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#163E64; text-decoration:none\">We have been advised that the monthly contributions for this participating employer are in arrears since March 2026 which is more than 2 months.&nbsp; </span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#163E64\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#163E64; text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;</span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#1F4E79; text-decoration:none\">Due to the changes in legislation , the Board of Trustees decided to suspend participation.</span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#1F4E79; text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;</span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#1F4E79; text-decoration:none\">Please find attached correspondence explaining the consequences for you, the Participating Employer and the members</span><span style=\"color:red; text-decoration:none\">. <b>Risk cover may have ceased</b></span><b><span style=\"color:#2F5597; text-decoration:none\">, </span></b><b><span style=\"color:#1F4E79; text-decoration:none\">if a claim would arise during this period of non-payment of contributions, we will not be liable to pay this claim and as a result the claim would be declined.</span></b></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#1F4E79; text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;</span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#163E64\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#163E64; text-decoration:none\">Should we not receive any feedback by<b> 15 June 2026</b> we will start with the termination of participation process and proceed to report the non-payment of contributions to the FSCA and the relevant authorities.</span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1F4E79\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#1F4E79; text-decoration:none\">We also need confirmation that you distributed the attached member communication to all members</span><span style=\"color:#1F4E79; font-weight:normal; text-decoration:none\">. </span><span style=\"color:#1F4E79; text-decoration:none\">Should we not receive confirmation the fund will contact the members directly per SMS to inform them of the outstanding contributions.</span></a></span></b></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:windowtext; text-decoration:none\">&nbsp;</span></a></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:windowtext; text-decoration:none\">Kind regards</span></a></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#0075C9\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:#0075C9; text-decoration:none\">Grechen Lieben</span></a></span></b></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt; line-height:105%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:105%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:gray\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"color:gray; text-decoration:none\">Fund Secretariat Administrator (Learner)</span></a></span></p><p class=\"xxmsonormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt; line-height:105%\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:105%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#333E48\"><a href=\"https://www.futurasa.co.za/\"><span style=\"c