 style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Masekang Moroko &lt;</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"mailto:Masekang.Moroko@pfa.org.za\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Masekang.Moroko@pfa.org.za</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&gt;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Sent:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> 06 August 2026 02:48 PM</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">To:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"mailto:malinkie.420@gmail.com\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">malinkie.420@gmail.com</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">; SCComplaints (SEB) &lt;</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"mailto:SCComplaints@sanlam.co.za\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">SCComplaints@sanlam.co.za</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&gt;; </span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"mailto:info@tasteoftennessee.co.za\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">info@tasteoftennessee.co.za</span></a><br></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Subject:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> [EXTERNAL] DETERMINATION IN TERMS OF SECTION M OF THE PENSION FUNDS ACT, 24 OF 1956 (“the Act”)</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; text-align:justify; line-height:15.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Good Day</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; text-align:justify; line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; text-align:justify; line-height:15.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Kindly find attached our determination in terms of section 30M of the Pension Funds Act, 1956. Kindly note that once a final determination has been handed down, our office can no longer entertain further submissions by the parties. However, kindly take notice of the following:</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\" style=\"margin-top:0cm\"><li style=\"margin-top:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; text-align:justify; line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">If you require assistance in understanding the outcome of the determination, you may contact our office and we will explain the determination to you.</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></li></ol><p style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; margin-left:36.0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><ol start=\"2\" type=\"1\" style=\"margin-top:0cm\"><li style=\"margin-top:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; text-align:justify; line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">If you require assistance in enforcing or challenging the outcome of a determination, you may require the assistance of an attorney. If you are unable to afford an attorney, you may approach Legal Aid South Africa. Their contact details are as follows:</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></li></ol><p style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; margin-left:36.0pt; line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; margin-left:36.0pt; line-height:115%\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">Legal Aid South Africa</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; margin-left:36.0pt; line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Tel: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 0800 110 110 (Monday to Friday 8AM - 4PM)</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; margin-left:36.0pt; line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Cell: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 079 835 7179 (Please Call Me)</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; margin-left:36.0pt; line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Email: &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"mailto:communications2@legal-aid.co.za\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\">communications2@legal-aid.co.za</span></a></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; margin-left:36.0pt; line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><ol start=\"3\" type=\"1\" style=\"margin-top:0cm\"><li style=\"margin-top:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; line-height:115%\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">Section 228 Notice:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></li></ol><p style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; margin-left:36.0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:15.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Any person aggrieved by the decision of the Pension Funds Adjudicator contained in a determination has the right to apply to the Financial Services Tribunal (“Tribunal”) in terms of section 230 of the Financial Sector Regulation Act, 2017 (“FSR Act”) for a reconsideration of the decision.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; margin-left:36.0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:15.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Such person also has the right to request reasons for the decision in terms of section 229 of the FSR Act however our determinations already contain the reasons for the decision made by the Pension Funds Adjudicator.</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; margin-left:36.0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:15.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Accordingly, any application for reconsideration should be made within 60 (sixty) days after you were notified of the determination, or such longer period as may on good cause be allowed by the Tribunal.</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:0cm; margin-left:36.0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:15.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">The contact details of the Tribunal Secretariat are:</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; text-indent:36.0pt; line-height:15.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Telephone:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (012) 741 4300</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; text-indent:36.0pt; line-height:15.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Email:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"mailto:Applications@fstribunal.co.za\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\">Applications@fstribunal.co.za</span></a></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; line-height:15.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"678\" height=\"331\" id=\"Picture_x0020_3\" src=\"cid:image006.gif@01DD2A8A.2BBB46D0\" style=\"width:7.0583in; height:3.45in\"></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm; line-height:15.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div id