font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@inboxatSUSimplementation</span></a></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Please can you update MIP accordingly with the new inception date.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Power App has been updated with new inception date.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Same SGR pin code can be used.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Roll over letter saved in the folder.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">No other changes applicable.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">You may proceed to update the inception date accordingly.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><a id=\"OWAAM6E6B773104744F7F8B5CA77738F77154\" href=\"mailto:SUSRules@sanlam.co.za\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@SUS Rules</span></a></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">As per confirmation the special rules have been approved.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Please follow the amendment process to have the inception date updated to 01/06/2026.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Roll over letter saved in the folder.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">No other changes applicable.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">I changed the status on Power App back to NUB Implementations.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">You may proceed to update the inception date accordingly.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><a href=\"file://scazfsprd01.azr.s