Futura@sanlam.co.za\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif; text-decoration:none\">@SGR NUB Futura</span></a></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Please can you update accordingly on your side to the new inception date 01/06/2026.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Roll over letter saved in the folder.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Once the date has been updated on MIP, you will receive an updated handover email from the implementations team.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">You may update the inception date as soon as you receive the handover email from implementations.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Regards</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><div><div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#0075C9\">Shelley Jennings<span style=\"letter-spacing:-2.0pt\"> </span></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:gray\">Onboarding Vetting Specialist</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#333E48\">Sanlam Corporate: </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#333E48\">PS:Core Operations</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#0075C9\">T </span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&